reeting":false,"role":"user","content":"Mostly I am counting the locks. Whether I did the bolt and the chain, and whether the back door is the way I left it.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":8,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"870d150acc264481849e5f762df59f4d","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0013250051959508178,"emotions":[{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":6,"sort":6},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":3,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":3,"sort":9},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":2,"sort":4},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":1,"sort":3},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6b03f0d06438f403db4d142f","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795420368169,"createTime":"2026-11-23 15:52:48","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b03f0c86438f403db4d1424","chatId":"645a89560b4c49d2a751b2b9bd95be54","sessionId":null,"userId":130557,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"Waking like that, already at the doors before you’re fully awake, sounds exhausting and unsettling. What goes through your mind in those first moments when you find yourself there?","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"Waking like that, already at the doors before you’re fully awake, sounds exhausting and unsettling. What goes through your m